===Etymology===
From {{der|de|la|Iob}}, from {{der|de|grc|Ἰώβ}}, from {{der|de|he|אִיּוֹב|tr=ʾiyyōḇ}}. The form in ''H-'' is a Medieval Latin spelling variant intended to secure the following ''-i-'' as a vowel rather than a semivowel.

